Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.27,0:00:02.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}拿去吧  菲比{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Here you go, Pheebs.{\r}
