Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.28,0:00:11.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}没关系  我不吃了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}That's okay.  I'm not having one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.03,0:00:14.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不  我是牙齿痛{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No, no. It's just my tooth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.29,0:00:16.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吧   我要吃一块{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}All right. I'll have one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.25,0:00:19.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你需要牙医吗   我的牙医很不错{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So you need a dentist? I've got a good one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:24.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}谢谢  我的牙医也很不错  但我没办法去看他{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Thanks. I have a good one too. I just can't see him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:27.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}看吧   那就是隐形牙医的问题{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}See, that is the problem with invisible dentists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.18,0:00:30.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}为什么你不能去看他{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Why can't you go to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.59,0:00:35.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}因为每次我去看牙医   都会有人死掉{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Because every time I go to the dentist, somebody dies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.81,0:00:39.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}真诡异  因为每次我去看牙医{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}That's so weird. Every time I go to the dentist...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.85,0:00:42.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我都会看助理的胸部{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...I look down the hygienist's blouse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.06,0:00:45.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}菲比  你说…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Phoebe, what, um?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.61,0:00:46.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}什么{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.86,0:00:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}第一次是我的玛丽阿姨{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}First, it was my Aunt Mary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.70,0:00:51.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}然后是我的邮差约翰{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And then there was, um, John, my mailman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.41,0:00:54.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我的牛仔朋友艾比诺巴伯{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And then my cowboy friend, Albino Bob.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.45,0:00:57.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这些人真的死了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ahem. And all these people actually died?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.62,0:00:59.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对  我去看牙医的时候{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yes. While I was in the chair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:03.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}所以我都自己保健牙齿  不是为了口腔卫生{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}That's why I take care of my teeth. It's not about oral hygiene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.42,0:01:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我用牙线是为了救人{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I floss to save lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.46,0:01:08.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}少来了  你没有杀人{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Come on, you didn't kill anybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.55,0:01:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这些人只是刚好  在你去看牙医时死掉了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}These people just happened to die when you went to the dentist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.43,0:01:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那是个巧合{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It's just a coincidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.10,0:01:16.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}去跟他们说吧  不行  他们死了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Tell that to them. Oh, you can't! They're dead!{\r}
