Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.19,0:02:07.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}中央咖啡厅{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.02,0:02:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}谢谢你  阿甘{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Thanks, Gunther.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.23,0:02:10.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嗨  嘿{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hi. Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.69,0:02:12.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}能给我一张纸巾吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Um, can I get a napkin too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.32,0:02:14.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你已经什么都有了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, like you don't already have everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.78,0:02:19.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}哦{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.33,0:02:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你痛得要命  你该去看牙医  快去吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You're in pain. Would you just go to the dentist? Just go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.17,0:02:26.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吧  如果你是我下一个受害者{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Fine. But if you're my next victim...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.75,0:02:29.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}别化身为厉鬼回来找我  把我吸进电视机里{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...don't come back as a poltergeist who sucks me into the TV set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.59,0:02:33.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}保证不会  但还是欢迎你来找我{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I promise. Although, don't feel like you can't visit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.51,0:02:38.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}钱德在吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey, is Chandler here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.85,0:02:41.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不  他不在{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No. No, he's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.39,0:02:47.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}大伙们  乔伊看到珍妮丝吻她的前夫{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You guys, Joey just saw Janice kissing her ex-husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.02,0:02:49.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}什么{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Huh? Oh! What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.32,0:02:52.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你打算怎么办   你怎么跟钱德说{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What are you gonna do? How are you gonna tell Chandler?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.53,0:02:53.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我一直在想这件事  最好的办法就是…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I was thinking about that. I think the best way would be...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.15,0:02:56.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}…不要说{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...to not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.91,0:03:01.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}乔伊  你知道这件事  就一定要告诉他{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Joey, if you know about this, you have to tell him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.33,0:03:03.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这会要了他的命{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It'll kill him. It'll just kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.79,0:03:06.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}等我去看牙医后再说吧   或许会先要了他的命{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Wait till I go to the dentist. Maybe I'll kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.75,0:03:12.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}哇{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ew!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.34,0:03:17.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}丑八怪裸男躺在吊床上  好像猪肉工厂喔{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ugly Naked Guy's using a hammock. It's like a Play-Doh fat factory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.26,0:03:20.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我要去看牙医  听我说{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm going to the dentist. So listen...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.51,0:03:24.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}小心别跌倒了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...just be on the lookout for anything that you could fall into...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.93,0:03:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}或是被掉下来的东西砸到{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...or that can fall on you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.77,0:03:29.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}或是…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...or...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.31,0:03:30.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吧  总之要小心{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}All right, just look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.19,0:03:34.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吗   我只是想…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay? And, um, I also just want to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.03,0:03:38.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我只是想告诉大家…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I just want to tell you all that, um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.41,0:03:46.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我有个问题   我得去忙上几个小时{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I have a problem. I have to go into work for a few hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.75,0:03:49.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}有一些小孩大闹智人展览 （与同性恋同字）{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Some kids messed up the Homo sapien display.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.29,0:03:50.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}怎么个闹法{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What did they do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.88,0:03:53.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}他们把招牌上的"智"字涂掉了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}They painted over the word "sapien," for one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.88,0:03:59.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}还把人偶重新排列  这个就不说了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs9\bord1\shad0\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Then they rearranged the figures. Let's just leave it at that.{\r}
